  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating access to quality and affordable medicine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide funding to iplussolutions, who wants to use its expertise to make the XS2Meds solution available to countries in sub-Saharan Africa or other LMIC to provide quality and affordable medicines covering HIV AIDS, Malaria and TB and include medicine for non-communicable diseases such as diabetes, hypertension, cancer and lung diseases as well as pain treatment and vaccines. This project concerns the first stage of the roll out of the initiative and the preparatory works related to it to test the viability of the initiative</narrative>
  </description>
